%% 06_sequence_generate_report -- one generation across the frontend, the API,
%% the services, Ollama and both databases. Numbers are the line at which
%% control passes on, at commit 99f3eab8. Full detail is in the caption file.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor D as Doctor
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as API
    participant GEN as Generation
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant CH as Chroma
    participant OL as Ollama

    D->>FE: press Generate
    FE->>API: POST /generate-report + cookie
    API->>DB: resolve the doctor from the JWT
    DB-->>API: Doctor, else 401
    API->>GEN: generate() :122
    GEN->>DB: session + evidence by rank :160
    DB-->>GEN: 5 uids and the REAL similarities
    GEN->>CH: get_by_ids()
    CH-->>GEN: case text, similarity forced to 1.0
    Note over GEN,CH: that 1.0 is a sentinel -- discarded, and the persisted similarities restored by uid
    GEN->>GEN: build context :170 (mode FULL), then the prompt
    loop content retry, budget 2
        GEN->>OL: /api/generate, temp 0.0, seed 42
        OL-->>GEN: raw text, then the 7-marker structural check
        Note over GEN,OL: on failure, a correction prompt. Attempt count NOT recorded -- D5 open
    end
    GEN->>GEN: validate_semantic() :182 -- ADVISORY, gates nothing
    GEN->>GEN: consistency :200 -- English gets all three checks, other languages none
    Note over GEN: failures here are caught broadly. retry_count is always 0 -- there is no Gate C
    GEN->>DB: top-1 by rank :219
    DB-->>GEN: the real top-1 similarity
    GEN->>GEN: classify support, render the SERVER-AUTHORED disclaimer :242
    GEN->>DB: INSERT reports :276
    DB-->>GEN: committed, else rollback and re-raise
    GEN-->>API: GenerationOutcome
    API-->>FE: 200 -- consistency derived from the values just persisted
    FE-->>D: /workspace/{id}/report
